## One warning

make the architecture something like:

```text
                 ┌───────────────┐
                 │  Visualizer   │
                 └───────┬───────┘
                         │
                 ┌───────▼───────┐
                 │   Emulator    │
                 ├───────────────┤
                 │ CPU           │
                 │ Memory        │
                 │ GPIO          │
                 │ Timer         │
                 │ UART          │
                 └───────┬───────┘
                         │
                 ┌───────▼───────┐
                 │ Program/ELF   │
                 └───────────────┘
```

The **emulator should work completely without the GUI**.

Then it can be tested:

```text
test_add()
test_sub()
test_branch()
test_gpio()
test_timer()
```

And the visualizer simply observes what the emulator is doing.

That separation will also teach some very useful software architecture.

